    "correctAnswerSourceText": "3",
    "explanation": "Adding humidity to the incubator adds moisture to the ambient air, which helps to decrease the insensible water loss. Bathing and the use of eye patches has no impact on insensible water loss. The use of a radiant warmer will increase the insensible water loss by drawing moisture out of the skin. CN: Reduction of risk potential; CL: Synthesize",
    "sourcePage": "256"
