    "correctAnswerSourceText": "3",
    "explanation": "Findings associated with osteomyelitis commonly include pain over the area, increased warmth, localized tenderness, and diffuse swelling over the involved bone. The area over the affected bone is red. CN: Physiological adaptation; CL: Analyze",
