    "explanation": "Sympathectomy is scheduled only after other treatment alternatives have been explored and have failed. Medication and stress management are beneficial strategies to prevent advancement of the disease process. If the disease is controlled by medication, there is no reason for surgery. CN: Physiological adaptation; CL: Apply The Client with Thrombophlebitis and Embolus Formation",
