      "C": "“Whenever I start to feel sorry for myself, I remember that my buddy died in that accident.” “I hope I can handle having a prosthesis, but I'm really wondering what my wife will think.”",
      "D": "A client demonstrates moderate anxiety regarding a pending medical procedure. The nurse should do which of the following to minimize the client's anxiety about the procedure?",
